WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,439
It seems that Xue Yu’s training was not in vain

2
00:00:06,439 --> 00:00:08,780
One hit

3
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:10,495
Baihuali

4
00:00:10,495 --> 00:00:14,497
Level 3 wood exchanged for dual attributes

5
00:00:14,497 --> 00:00:16,784
Extremely fast

6
00:00:16,784 --> 00:00:19,643
Have exchange attributes

7
00:00:19,643 --> 00:00:21,930
Ball connecting talent

8
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:25,360
Can overpower the enemy

9
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,550
It turns out to be Baihuali

10
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:30,144
Junior Brother Chu

11
00:00:30,144 --> 00:00:33,866
What kind of technology do you have?

12
00:00:33,866 --> 00:00:38,650
After touching it, it stopped making trouble.

13
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:41,650
It’s just a little trick I learned from hunting in the mountains before.

14
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:45,480
This flower pear seems to be pregnant

15
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:51,770
True or false, third-level Baihuali is also rare, so why don’t you report it to the manager?

16
00:00:51,770 --> 00:00:58,700
Senior Brother Gu, don’t report it. If you do, Tu Jiarong probably won’t let this Baihuali go.

17
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:04,790
Can you leave it to me? I promise not to let him steal the magical herbs from the medicine field again, but, okay

18
00:01:04,790 --> 00:01:07,790
Then we'll keep him for now and wait until he's finished giving birth.
